171
00:05:21.177 --> 00:05:23.225
Give a short answer and a full answer.

172
00:05:23.505 --> 00:05:26.727
Do you work on weekends? / Is the office far from here?

173
00:05:28.077 --> 00:05:28.994
Success:

174
00:05:29.274 --> 00:05:30.426
