175
00:05:30.706 --> 00:05:31.666
No, I don't.

176
00:05:31.946 --> 00:05:35.338
I only work Monday to Friday. / No, it isn't.

177
00:05:35.618 --> 00:05:37.282
It's about ten minutes by auto.

178
00:05:38.632 --> 00:05:39.507
Part 8.

179
00:05:39.787 --> 00:05:40.832
Speak today.

180
